resources/Article/

# =========================
# Datasets kept on this computer only (ADR-021)
# TCGA_LUAD (589, 57772, 2) is 391 MB per file — over GitHub's 100 MB limit. Its ReadMe.txt
# (tracked) says where to download it; erdr catalogues it whenever the files are present.
# =========================
datasets/Quantitative/TCGA_LUAD/*.csv
datasets/Quantitative/TCGA_LUAD/*.dat

